Key.Chinesesimp:

                要开始伪装，你必须满足以下条件:
				\n你必须穿着完整的敌军背心、头盔，并手持敌军主武器(你可以在敌军尸体上获取它们);
				\n背包、副手武器和夜视仪可以不装备，但若装备则必须是敌军的款式。(你可以在敌军尸体上获取它们)
				\n不需要敌军的制服，因为ARMA3有对制服的阵营限制。当你有了上方的正确配装时，制服会自动添加给你。

				\n而要保持伪装状态，你必须：
				\n你必须穿着完整的敌军制服(动作成功后自动添加)、背心、头盔，并手持敌军主武器(你可以在敌军尸体上获取它们);
				\n背包、副手武器和夜视仪可以不装备，但若装备则必须是敌军的款式。(你可以在敌军尸体上获取它们);
				\n不距离敌人过近;
				\n两次成功伪装之间的冷却时间为10分钟

Key.Original:

                To start your disguise, you must meet the following conditions:
				\n Do not hold any weapons/binoculars in your hands, do not equip night vision devices;
				\n Clothes, vests and helmets must be the same as civilian outfits in the current civilian mode (Get them from the Arsenal or civilians);
				\n Backpack must be civilian style (available from the Arsenal)

				\n To maintain your disguise status, you must:
				\n Do not hold any weapons/binoculars in your hands, do not equip night vision devices (you can hide whatever you want in a civilian backpack);
				\n Clothes, vests and helmets must be the same as civilian outfits in the current civilian mode (available from the Arsenal);
				\n Backpack must be civilian style (available from the Arsenal);
				\n Do not take out binoculars while in disguise;
				\n Do not get too close to enemies;
				\n Do not enter non-civilian vehicles;
				\n Do not take actions that lower your reputation;
				\n Do not enter towns when your reputation is negative;
				\n 1-minute cooldown between two successful disguises

Key.English:

                To start your disguise, you must meet the following conditions:
				\n Do not hold any weapons/binoculars in your hands, do not equip night vision devices;
				\n Clothes, vests and helmets must be the same as civilian outfits in the current civilian mode (Get them from the Arsenal or civilians);
				\n Backpack must be civilian style (available from the Arsenal)

				\n To maintain your disguise status, you must:
				\n Do not hold any weapons/binoculars in your hands, do not equip night vision devices (you can hide whatever you want in a civilian backpack);
				\n Clothes, vests and helmets must be the same as civilian outfits in the current civilian mode (available from the Arsenal);
				\n Backpack must be civilian style (available from the Arsenal);
				\n Do not take out binoculars while in disguise;
				\n Do not get too close to enemies;
				\n Do not enter non-civilian vehicles;
				\n Do not take actions that lower your reputation;
				\n Do not enter towns when your reputation is negative;
				\n 5-minute cooldown between two successful disguises

Key.Chinesesimp:
要开始伪装，你必须满足以下条件:
\n不拿着任何武器/望远镜，不装备任何夜视仪;
\n衣服/背心/头盔必须为当前模式下平民的同款装束(你可以在军火库或平民身上获取它们);
\n背包需要为民用款式(你可以在军火库获取它们)

\n而要保持伪装状态，你必须：
\n不拿着任何武器/望远镜，不装备任何夜视仪(你可以将想使用的东西塞进民用背包内隐蔽携带);
\n衣服/背心/头盔必须为当前模式下平民的同款装束(你可以在军火库获取它们);
\n背包需要为民用款式(你可以在军火库获取它们);
\n不在伪装时掏出望远镜;
\n不距离敌人过近;
\n不进入非民用载具;
\n不做让声望下降的事情;
\n不在声望为负数时进入城镇;
\n两次成功伪装之间的冷却时间为5分钟
